WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:07.077
First, instead of guessing raw code word by word, small models predict compact summaries of program meaning.

2
00:00:07.417 --> 00:00:14.771
Second, any AI model may propose a candidate program, but a fast, strict checker decides what passes.

3
00:00:15.111 --> 00:00:22.195
Third, checking uses seventeen hundred times less energy than generating, and saved fixes slash big model calls.
